processed_gene/

# === Trained model weights (1.2 GB each for UNI ViT-L) ===
# results_pg/ IS committed — its 72 result JSONs are the actual findings, ~5.7 MB
# in total. Only the checkpoints are excluded: 4 files = 4.5 GB, far past
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit. Regenerate with scripts/run_uni_ceiling.py
# (which now persists them, so re-deriving a metric is a re-eval not a retrain).
*.pt
*.pth
